{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36876","headline":"甘露寺看雪上周相公 · 罗隐","name":"甘露寺看雪上周相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筛寒洒白乱溟蒙，祷请功兼造化功。\n光薄乍迷京口月，影交初展海门风。\n细黏谢客衣裾上，轻堕梁王酒醆中。\n一种爲祥君看取，半禳灾沴半年丰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}